{"meta":{"id":"lambda","category":"it/syntax/java/function","title":"람다 · 함수형 인터페이스 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"Function · Supplier · Consumer · Predicate, 메서드 참조 ::","tags":["java","f-function"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">람다 · 함수형 인터페이스 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Function · Supplier · Consumer · Predicate, 메서드 참조 ::</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">람다 · 함수형 인터페이스</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">Function&lt;Integer, Integer&gt; square = x -&gt; x * x;\r\nBiFunction&lt;Integer, Integer, Integer&gt; add = (a, b) -&gt; a + b;\r\nSupplier&lt;String&gt; hello = () -&gt; &quot;hi&quot;;\r\nConsumer&lt;String&gt; print = System.out::println;    // 메서드 참조\r\nPredicate&lt;String&gt; empty = String::isEmpty;\r\n\r\nsquare.apply(3);                                 // 9\r\n\r\n@FunctionalInterface\r\ninterface Calc { int run(int a, int b); }        // TS 의 type Calc = (a, b) =&gt; number\r\nCalc mul = (a, b) -&gt; a * b;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">익명 클래스 → 람다 (단계별)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@FunctionalInterface\r\ninterface MyFunc1 { int add(int x, int y); }     // 추상 메서드가 단 1개인 인터페이스\r\n\r\n// 1. 익명 클래스로 구현\r\nMyFunc1 f1 = new MyFunc1() {\r\n    @Override\r\n    public int add(int x, int y) { return x + y; }\r\n};\r\nf1.add(1, 2);\r\n\r\n// 2. 생성 즉시 사용\r\nnew MyFunc1() { @Override public int add(int x, int y) { return x + y; } }.add(1, 2);\r\n\r\n// 3. 람다 — 메서드 이름 · 매개변수 타입 생략\r\nMyFunc1 f2 = (x, y) -&gt; { return x + y; };\r\n\r\n// 4. 한 줄이면 { } 와 return 생략\r\nMyFunc1 f3 = (x, y) -&gt; x + y;</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">람다식을 쓰려면 먼저 <strong>함수형 인터페이스</strong>(추상 메서드 1개)를 만든다 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>@FunctionalInterface</code> 는 2개 이상이면 컴파일 오류로 막아 준다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>default</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>static</code> 메서드는 추상 메서드가 아니므로 함께 있어도 된다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 함수 타입, JavaScript › 화살표 함수</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/function/lambda","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"function","title":"함수","path":"it/syntax/java/function"}],"hasImage":false}